# ---------------------------------------------------------------- secrets
# API keys for hosted model backends. The engine reads these from the
# environment; nothing in this repository should ever contain one.
.env
.env.*
*.key
secrets/

# Throwaway stubs and configs used while testing against a real machine.
.scratch/

# CMake build trees for the firmware, including the picotool clone it fetches.
sdk/machines/*/firmware/build/
# Host-built test binaries that sit beside their source.
*.exe

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Bob --------
#
# The Jura ENA 8 retrofit lives in its own repository, beside this one. It was
# separated because it carries reverse-engineered vendor protocol detail -
# service-port verbs and a table of product codes - and publishing that needs
# its own decision, which the engine and the protocol should not wait for.
#
# These paths are ignored rather than merely absent so that a stray copy cannot
# find its way back into a commit. The machine's own repository is the one to
# edit; a copy left here will drift and nothing will say so.
sdk/machines/bob/
sdk/c/generated/adip_generated_bob.c
sdk/c/generated/adip_generated_bob.h
BOB-DEPLOY.md

# Model prompt and reply traces. ADI_TRACE names a FILE, so setting it to `1`
# writes a trace to a file called `1`, which is how one got loose.
sdk/1
*.trace
trace*.txt

# Speech the speaker seam wrote, numbered per turn.
sdk/spoken-*.wav
spoken-*.wav

# Correspondence and working notes that have nothing to do with the project.
log.txt
log*.txt

# Superseded planning documents, and the index of them. They record why
# decisions were made rather than what the code does, every one of them is
# already ignored by name, and an index of files a reader cannot see is worse
# than no index.
docs/history/
docs/
